    "text": "$9$"
   }
  ],
  "answer": "A",
  "acceptedAnswers": null,
  "answerUnit": null,
  "solutions": [
   {
    "title": "Powers of 2",
    "body": "$2^{10}=1024$ and $2^{11}=2048$. Since $2003$ is very close to $2048$ (and $2003$ is between $2^{10}$ and $2^{11}$, much nearer to $2^{11}$ on a logarithmic scale: $2048/2003\\approx1.02$ while $2003/1024\\approx1.96$), $x$ is just below $11$, so the closest integer is $11$.\n\n**Answer: (A) 11**"
   }
  ],
