  "timeMinutes": null,
  "type": "mc",
  "prompt": "Egoli municipality has two different formulae for calculating monthly charges for electricity. For a consumer using an amount $E$ of electricity, the cost $C$ is given by either $C=60+0.2E$ or $C=0.3(E-50)$. The first formula gives cheaper electricity when",
