  "solutions": [
   {
    "title": "Count paths letter by letter",
    "body": "The number of paths to a letter is the sum of the numbers of paths to the letters above it that it is joined to. Writing these in the pattern gives $1$; $1,1$; $1,2,1$; $1,3,3,1$; $4,6,4$; $10,10$; $20$ — entries of Pascal's triangle. The last number is $20$.\n\n**Answer: (B) 20**"
